{"\n","\n"}],RowBox[{RowBox[{"Print","[","\"Question 2: The experimentally observed vib. frequencies for CCl4 show agreement with calculated values. The modes in the 180-60 cm^-1 region differ from calculations by approximately 20-35 cm^-1 which is consistent with expectations. However, in the region of v3 there are large discrepancies of up to 60 cm^-1  \nFor CHCl3 the calculated frequencies show strong agreement with the experimental values. The modes fall within 10-40 cm^-1. THe largest deviations occur in the C-H stretching bend. \"","]"}],"\n","\n","\n","\n"}]}],
