BoxData[
"\"Question 2: The experimentally observed vib. frequencies for CCl4 show agreement with calculated values. The modes in the 180-60 cm^-1 region differ from calculations by approximately 20-35 cm^-1 which is consistent with expectations. However, in the region of v3 there are large discrepancies of up to 60 cm^-1  \\nFor CHCl3 the calculated frequencies show strong agreement with the experimental values. The modes fall within 10-40 cm^-1. THe largest deviations occur in the C-H stretching bend. \"",
StandardForm],"Print",ExpressionUUID -> "ca464be5-5a36-4d84-9656-1380880b5ed9"]},
Open],ExpressionUUID -> "31a6bc68-c92a-489f-9ddc-4e3196ebe3e1"]},Open],ExpressionUUID -> "30a6f3b0-e632-46a1-a5bd-e16bad5ae29b"],Cell[
